   "definition_quote": "Here there are $K$ arms, where each consecutive pull of the $i^{th}$ arm produces bounded i.i.d. rewards ... $Y_{i,1}\\in [0,1]$ ... there are batch end points $0=T_0<T_1<...$, and the actions the agent plays in the $j^{th}$ batch ... as well as the size of the batch itself ... can depend only on the information present in $\\Hp_{T_{j-1}}$ ... Finally, we let $\\mu_1>\\mu_i$ for any $i\\geq 2$."
